From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pblsketch <239486537+pblsketch@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:27:11 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] fix(cell): relay cell lines when a cell picture turns from
 inline to Square wrap

Port of IeumOffice patch 0055 (0.9.0-ieum.32) onto rhwp v0.9.1 + patches 0001..0060.

- Reflow the host cell paragraph via layout_container_picture_band when setCellPicturePropertiesByPath changes treatAsChar, placement, or size.
- Default cell pictures released from treatAsChar to HorzRelTo::Column with restrictInPage (flow_with_text) enabled, leaving cellSz untouched so sync_tac_host_rows can adjust the host row.
- Include cell_first_para_float_lead in cell paragraph height and first-line vertical offset when the first line is pushed below a paragraph-relative Square/Tight/Through object.
- Anchor floating objects in v0.9.1 cell_flow_objects_bottom_height / calc_cell_flow_objects_bottom_height at flow_start + before.flow_before instead of before.occupied_before() so the float lead is not counted twice below the object itself.
